<tr><td><code>dispersion_S_random</code></td><td class="num">0.05</td><td>Dispersion of the S waves, eq. (13), for randomly oriented cracks of aspect ratio 1e-3 at the crack density 0.3. </td><td class="where">Section 3.2, p. 171 (&quot;close to 5.10^-2&quot;)</td></tr>
